    gui_window_caller_frame_silent_interp_fallback_2026-08-06, 1, "2026-11-13: Not attempted. Static read at release/1.0.0 c8c3e7bc4f1, Linux aarch64 (DGX Spark GB10), Rust seed af717f53d6bce3e5: the live remainder is whole-module JIT demotion, current trigger the same-name different-layout pair JsError/JsBrowserError (common/js/engine/js_error.spl alias vs nogc_sync_mut/js/engine/js_error.spl classes) rejected in the seed at hir/lower/module_lowering/module_pass.rs qualify_flattened_structs. Fix is either a JS-engine rename across about 50 importers or a seed HIR change; both belong to the compiler/JS lanes, and the trigger has already moved once."

    gui_window_caller_frame_silent_interp_fallback_2026-08-06, 2, "2026-11-13 lane uia2: JsBrowserError trigger FIXED, row stays open. flatten_struct_owner.rs rejects any type alias of a class declared with several layouts; common/js/engine/js_error.spl aliased JsBrowserError to the two-layout JsError. The alias had 28 importers and zero uses; alias, export and imports removed. js_error_alias_owner_spec 3 examples 1 failure then 3 examples 0 failures; strict 8x8 probe on release/1.0.0 ad8c53a216b no longer names the alias. Module still demotes: next triggers measured are unimported env_get in sffi_vulkan.spl (filed sffi_vulkan_env_get_unimported_jit_demotion_2026-11-13) and backend_vulkan.spl, then an unlocated Sub on an unwrapped optional."
